id: pm-gh1458
title: "GH-1458: Preserve linked-test edit history across older published readers and writers"
description: "Investigate reports that 2026.10.12+ tests_update editor stamps are dropped by older published hosts sharing item_hash_version3, causing false corruption and subsequent nested-field loss. Expand real published-artifact compatibility beyond top-level extension fields and retain original append-only evidence."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
