acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce nested linked-test editor stamps through actual 2026.10.9/10/13 artifacts in isolated trackers; Verify exact nested values, before/after commitments, ordinary mutation, restore and native merge; New writers refuse unsupported format writes or preserve declared cross-version hash semantics; Diagnostics recommend a supported verifier upgrade and never destructive history re-anchoring; Compatibility coverage executes every newly written operation and nested field against supported prior hosts"
