confidence: medium
resolution: "Persist item format2 with real editor-field writes, preserve required format and immutable history through restore/merge, refuse incompatible project pins and extend real published-artifact acceptance."
expected_result: Supported mixed-version consumers preserve nested values and commitments or refuse unsupported formats before modifying evidence; legacy baseline records remain readable.
actual_result: "All105 linked cases and4 baseline plus3 historical artifact rows pass, including exact nested fields, unchanged-byte refusals, SDK reads, restore, native merges and verified original history prefixes;10420 full-suite tests pass at exact100% coverage."
